      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain control in endodontics is paramount to patient acceptance of this special area of dental care. Alleviating existing pain is the primary objective of root canal therapy. This paper focuses on the control of pulp and periradicular pain at initial presentation and subsequent to the first visit."},
